{
  "date": "2025-11-20",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모하냐",
      "en": "What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내생각중이라고 그러면",
      "en": "If you say you're thinking about me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뻔하지~",
      "en": "That's too obvious~"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "너 선글라스 판매하니?",
      "en": "Do you sell sunglasses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "으음?",
      "en": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 가?",
      "en": "Me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 사장님인데",
      "en": "I'm the boss, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "관리감독하는",
      "en": "The one who manages and supervises."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 이제 롱패딩 꺼냈어",
      "en": "I finally took out my long padded jacket."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저번에 학교가는데 가디건 하나입고갔다가",
      "en": "Last time I went to school wearing only a cardigan..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "바람이 나만 집중공격 하더라고",
      "en": "The wind decided to target only me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이거 진짜임",
      "en": "I'm serious."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "옆에는 바람 별로 안부는데",
      "en": "The people next to me barely had any wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나만 날라가려해",
      "en": "Only I was about to get blown away."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "상여자 ㄷㄷ",
      "en": "Boss lady ㄷㄷ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이제 알았나 ㅋ",
      "en": "You only realized that now? ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쇼케가 진짜 별로 안남았어",
      "en": "There's really not much time left until the showcase."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 떨린다",
      "en": "I'm kind of nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오랜만이라기엔 깨어가 올해였지만",
      "en": "Even though 'Are You Alive?' was this year..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래도 새로운 느낌",
      "en": "It still feels new."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내첫 유닛 데뷔활동!!",
      "en": "It's my first unit debut promotion!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "연말행사들도 있으니까",
      "en": "There are year-end events too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "더 떨려",
      "en": "So I'm even more nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 떠는사람 아닌데 참나 ㅋ",
      "en": "I'm not even someone who gets nervous, seriously. ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "넥스트가 처음이긴했지만",
      "en": "NXT came first, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우린 활동을 하진 않았으니까",
      "en": "We didn't actually promote."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "처음 맞쥥",
      "en": "So this is basically my first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하이틴컨셉일 줄은 몰랐어",
      "en": "I didn't expect it to be a high-teen concept."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 너무좋아",
      "en": "That's why I love it so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "완저니 내스탈이잔앙",
      "en": "It's totally my style."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "여전히 교복이지만",
      "en": "It's still school uniforms..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다른느낌",
      "en": "But it has a different vibe."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지치고 힘들지만 다시 일어나거라 10대들이여",
      "en": "\"You're exhausted and struggling, but get back up, teenagers!\" That was the previous feeling."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 느낌이였지만",
      "en": "That was the vibe before."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이번엔",
      "en": "But this time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "흥! 이미 일어나 있엉 ㅎ 나 최고",
      "en": "\"Hmph! I'm already up. Hehe, I'm the best.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런느낌",
      "en": "That's the kind of vibe."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "밥시킬깡",
      "en": "Should I order food?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "밥시켜서 라이브?",
      "en": "Order food and go live?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 좀",
      "en": "Today I'm kind of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이뻐",
      "en": "Pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "칭찬 많이 받엄서",
      "en": "I got a lot of compliments."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘은 ㄹㅇ",
      "en": "Today I really am..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "성숙",
      "en": "Mature."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시크",
      "en": "Chic."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 어쩜 좋아 ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "What am I supposed to do with myself? ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 그리고",
      "en": "Oh, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가",
      "en": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "된찌 만드는 브이로그?",
      "en": "A vlog where I make doenjang jjigae?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요리로그?",
      "en": "Or maybe a cooking vlog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "찍었었는데",
      "en": "I filmed one."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아냐 브이로그라기엔",
      "en": "Actually, calling it a vlog is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음식만 나와",
      "en": "Only the food appears."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 편집도 함",
      "en": "I edited it myself too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저번에 안나가서",
      "en": "It didn't get released last time."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이번에 공개할수있음 할려구",
      "en": "If I can, I'll release it this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "짧아 ㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "It's short though. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "숏츠로 올라가지 않을까",
      "en": "It'll probably be uploaded as a Short."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "따라 만들라고 찍음",
      "en": "I filmed it so everyone could cook along."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맛있어서 놀람 ㅋ",
      "en": "I was surprised by how tasty it was. ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "된찌 최애 린이 먹어봤어?",
      "en": "Did Lyn, the biggest doenjang jjigae fan, try it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촌캉스 갔을때 먹었지",
      "en": "She ate it when we went on the countryside trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 그때는",
      "en": "But back then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시중 소스를 써서",
      "en": "I used store-bought sauce."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "온전히 내 실력은 아니긴했는데",
      "en": "So it wasn't entirely my own skill."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래도 쩔었음",
      "en": "But it was still amazing."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "원래는 뭐쓰는데? 된장을 직접 만들어?",
      "en": "Then what do you normally use? Do you make the doenjang yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 콩빻아서 막?",
      "en": "Oh, like grinding soybeans and everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "응응",
      "en": "Yep yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 다 건조 시켜서 잘 담그고",
      "en": "I dry and ferment everything myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "장",
      "en": "The paste too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야채도 길러서",
      "en": "I grow the vegetables too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자르교",
      "en": "Then chop them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "냄비도 직접 만들어서",
      "en": "I even make the pot myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저것도",
      "en": "That too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나무도 공예해서",
      "en": "I even do woodcraft."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이쁘게",
      "en": "Make it all pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어어",
      "en": "Uh-huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "된찌 만드는데 10년걸리겟네",
      "en": "It'll take ten years just to make the stew."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "태어날때부터 만들었지",
      "en": "I've been making it since the day I was born."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "밥 뭐시킬지만 보고올게",
      "en": "I'll just go decide what to order."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "딱기다려",
      "en": "Just wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 계란 먹을거임",
      "en": "Actually, I'm just going to eat eggs."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "10분뒤쯤 킬게",
      "en": "I'll turn it on in about ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재정비좀 할게요~",
      "en": "Let me get everything ready first~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쉬고 있어",
      "en": "Take a rest while you wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "image": "image-01.webp"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "심심하지",
      "en": "You're bored, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "얘랑 데이트 하고있어",
      "en": "Go on a date with this while you wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "킬게~",
      "en": "I'll go live~"
    }
  ]
}